<item><title>IGAD brings 2023 treaty into force, replacing its 1996 agreement</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/igad-brings-2023-treaty-into-force-replacing-its-1996-bddab0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/igad-brings-2023-treaty-into-force-replacing-its-1996-bddab0/</guid><category>Ethiopia</category><description>The eight-member bloc&apos;s new treaty covers 18 areas of cooperation, including trade, free movement of people and agriculture.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:28:30 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/igad-brings-2023-treaty-into-force-replacing-its-1996-bddab0/share.jpg" length="43348" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/igad-brings-2023-treaty-into-force-replacing-its-1996-bddab0/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ethiopia opens central bank sandbox for financial firms</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-opens-central-bank-sandbox-for-financial-firms-4cb785/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/et/ethiopia-opens-central-bank-sandbox-for-financial-firms-4cb785/</guid><category>Ethiopia</category><description>The framework lets banks, fintechs and insurers test products under National Bank supervision before seeking full approval or wider market entry.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:31:04 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" length="32890" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/et.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
